	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Redditae sunt interea, dum affines mei discesserunt, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>tę per <persName ref="p8052">Valentinum Ampelandrum</persName>, <persName ref="p8417">Musculi</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>generum, missae una cum sermonum tuorum exem<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>plaribus et d. <persName ref="p8359">Gallitii</persName> literis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ago pro omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>gratias, agit item <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Metuit et ipse <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>sibi plurimum a pacificatione illa inter Caesarem et <persName>Gallum</persName>; <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>sed speramus non processuram.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Varia hic feruntur, sed in<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>certa: <persName>Caesarem</persName> certum moliri in <placeName ref="l875">Hispaniam</placeName> reditum, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>fratri et filio tradidisse omnia; in <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> saevire <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>antichristum; <persName ref="p1560">Hopperum</persName> et alios quosdam exustos, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/><placeName ref="l1255">Cantuariensem</placeName>, <placeName ref="l296">Londinensem</placeName> et <placeName>Latimerum</placeName> adhuc esse in <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>vinculis.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quae nos valde cruciant; confirmet illos <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>dominus in finem.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Collectam pro <placeName ref="l294">Locarnensibus</placeName> dif<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ferendam censes in aliud tempus, donec certas obtineant <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>sedes; sed nobis secus visum fuit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Itaque, dum occasione<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>m habuimus et animi viderentur prompti, institutum et per <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>domini gratiam impetravimus, ut 100 coronati ex aerario dent<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ur et, ut adhuc speramus, a privatis ditioribus contri<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>butio sit futura.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Fortassis tantum non potuisset impetrari, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>si per moram longiorem deferbuisset studium hoc, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>et malo nostram ecclesiam inter primas esse quam inter <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>postremas.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Si quibus visum fuerit ad nos concedere, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>nihilominus recipientur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quę proxime scripseram ad fratrem <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>de clade accepta in <placeName ref="l736">Pedemontana</placeName>, audio nihil esse.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Se<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>nas aiunt a Caesareanis captas; sed quam certum sit affirm<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>are non possum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Mirum <persName>Scęvolę</persName> cuiusdam christia<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ni factum retulit mihi <persName ref="p8033">Beza</persName> noster, quod, ut compleam <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>chartam, dignum videtur, ut scribam.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Tornaci ait in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>quendam plebeium sacerdoti hostiam suam inter missandum <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>levanti eripuisse ad aram violenter confractamque con<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>iecisse in pavimentum et pedibus conculcasse exclamando ad <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>populum: "Proh, qualem deum colitis" etc.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Mox vero comp<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>rehensus talem sententiam habuit, ut primo exureretur <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>illi manus nepharia, qua tantum scelus aggressus sit, deinde <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>pes alter, quo hostiam (ut vocant) protriverit, postea cremaretur <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>totus.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Ille igne adhibito manum ulro imposuit <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>et sine ulla doloris significatione ustionem illius passus est; pari <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>modo ridens pedem quoque igni imposuit dicens <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>foelicissimum hunc esse gradum seu gressum, quo in <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>vitam ingrediatur aeternam.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Cum itaque deficeret iam, in rogum <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>coniectus ad dominum concessit, dignum certe historia exemplum.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Ita <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Christus adhuc vincit per crucem; ipsi sit gloria in aeternum.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z43"/>Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">D. <persName ref="p8359">Philippi Gallitii</persName> literas remitto; exeruit se illic <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>quoque mirabiliter potentia dei; benedictum sit nomen eius in sęcula.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z45"/>Salutant te nostri omnes, <persName ref="p8012">Hallerus</persName>, <persName ref="p8389">Hagius</persName>, <persName ref="p3494">Diespachius</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z46"/><persName>Gironus</persName>, <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName>, <persName ref="p2919">Schlatterus</persName> et alii.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Salvi sint vestri <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>omnes.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 5. martii 1555.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z48"/><persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae pastori <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>fidelissimo, domino et compatri suo <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>honorando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
